# Compliance and Audit

- Keep full traceability from requirement to production evidence.
- Tag PII-sensitive flows and apply masking and access controls.
- Capture approval evidence for architecture, security, and release gates.
- Store immutable decision logs for major trade-offs.

# Evidence Requirements

- Every release must include test, security, and operational evidence bundle.
- Retain migration reconciliation reports per cutover phase.
